# One price check, driven by nothing but a pad.
#
# Counted in polls of the frame loop, not seconds, so a slow machine runs the
# same script as a fast one. The frame loop polls every 100ms.

wait 40

press L1+R1+Triangle

wait 80

press DOWN
press DOWN

press RIGHT
press CROSS

press UP
press RIGHT

press CROSS

wait 10

press CIRCLE
